        },
        "question_mWA49F": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I wash my Nodpod BODY?",
            "answer": "<p>To avoid stress on the seams, it is important to wash your Nodpod BODY with a full load of laundry. The best would be to wash it with a fluffy blanket or other large soft items. This will preserve the life of your Nodpod BODY.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_3KCwCt": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes this different from a full size weighted blanket?",
            "answer": "<p>You do not need a full size weighted blanket in order to received the benefits of Deep Touch Pressure. Nodpod BODY's design offers concentrated weight to hug the areas that need it most.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
