        "question_ajEpWA": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who should not use a weighted blanket?",
            "answer": "<p>Using a weighted blanket may not be suitable for individuals who have difficulty removing it from their body due to its weight. Furthermore, people with certain medical conditions such as sleep apnea, breathing difficulties like asthma, sleep disorders, or claustrophobia, should either refrain from using a weighted blanket or consult with a physician before doing so.</p>",
