          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HSA/FSA"
          }
        },
        "question_8pp6FE": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use my HSA or FSA to pay for Nodpod products?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Nodpod products may qualify for HSA/FSA reimbursement when purchased with a Letter of Medical Necessity (LMN) through our partner, Truemed. Truemed determines eligibility at checkout in real time.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_yEUyAz": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does it work?",
            "answer": "<p>At checkout, select the Truemed HSA/FSA payment option. You'll answer a few quick health-related questions, and Truemed's clinical team will confirm eligibility. If approved, you can pay directly with your HSA/FSA card — no separate reimbursement claim needed.</p><p><em>Note: If you have a Shop account, you'll need to check out as a guest for the Truemed option to appear.</em></p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_Y6LYB7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need a doctor's note?",
            "answer": "<p>No separate visit is required. Truemed's LMN process happens online in minutes as part of checkout.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_VLiA68": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if I don't have an HSA/FSA card handy at checkout?",
            "answer": "<p>You can still complete your purchase with a regular payment method and submit for reimbursement separately, though using Truemed at checkout is faster and doesn't require you to file a claim yourself.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_9dNfKH": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns"
          }
        },
        "question_wKkket": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Return Policy",
            "answer": "<p>Any order purchased from nodpod.com* can be returned within 30 days. If not completely satisfied, simply return the product for a prompt refund. </p><p>For easy returns use our Easy Returns Portal <a href=\"https://nodpod.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Nodpod Loop Returns\">here.</a></p><p>*Products purchased from any other retailer or website (Amazon, Anthropologie, Nordstrom, etc.) must be returned to the original seller.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_8yaec6": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping"
          }
        },
        "question_jANxwn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping Policy",
            "answer": "<p>Nodpod products can be shipped to anywhere that has a physical address within the USA. We ship to PO Boxes.</p><p>There is a 2-5 business day process time for all orders. While we strive to ship an order within 3 working days, we can’t directly control the delivery times beyond our end.</p><p>As a general rule, assume that your shipment will take 6–8 working days. APO addresses will be shipped via USPS and cannot be rush shipped.</p><p>Orders that do not qualify for free shipping are $6.99 flat rate. Free shipping threshold applies to subtotal. (cart amount after discounts and before tax)</p><p>Any free shipping promotions only qualify for addresses within the contiguous United States.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_eQagTW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Lost & Stolen Package Policy",
            "answer": "<p>We want you to receive your order safely. If your package is confirmed lost in transit by the carrier, we'll replace it at no cost to you. For packages marked as delivered but reported missing or stolen, coverage depends on whether shipping protection was purchased at checkout:</p><ul><li><strong>With shipping protection:</strong> We'll replace your order at no additional cost.</li><li><strong>Without shipping protection:</strong> We're unable to guarantee a free replacement, but we're happy to offer a discounted replacement.</li></ul><p>We recommend adding shipping protection at checkout for peace of mind on every order.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_AGTw7H": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will I get my order by Christmas?",
            "answer": "<p>Any orders placed by December 11, 2025 by 11:59PM are guaranteed to arrive by Christmas barring any delays from shipping carriers. Any orders placed after December 11th are not guaranteed to arrive by Christmas but still may. </p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "question_bMNtkr": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I cancel my order or change my shipping address?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>We're unable to make any changes to an order once it has been placed. </strong></p><p>Our fulfillment process begins quickly so your items arrive as soon as possible. Please double-check that your order details are correct before completing your purchase.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_RKCAe6": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Sale Policy"
          }
        },
        "question_87WgEW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Sale Policy",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Sale Duration</strong></p><p>LIMITED TIME ONLY. Sale dates use Pacific Time (PT) as a standard and end on the date indicated. If no end time is specified, the end time is assumed to be 11:59 PM. If no end date is specified, the sale may end at any time without prior warning.</p><p><strong>Exclusions</strong></p><p>Online price reflects discount. Offer available for select styles only. No substitutions will be allowed. Advertised sale prices cannot be combined with any other offer, discount, or coupon. No adjustments on previous purchases will be permitted. Only orders completed within the defined sales period qualify for sales price. Nodpod® reserves the right to cancel any order for any reason. Offers subject to change without notice.</p><p><strong>Price Matching</strong></p><p>Nodpod.com does not price match any retailer (online or brick and mortar).</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        },
        "heading_C3JdAy": {
          "type": "heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Guarantee Policy"
          }
        },
        "question_EREbNG": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Guarantee Policy",
            "answer": "<p>We proudly stand behind all of our products. Nodpod® has a 30 day money back guarantee, but, if for any reason you’re not satisfied, send it back for a full product refund, no questions asked. Products purchased from any other retailer or website (Amazon, Nordstrom, etc.) must be returned to the original seller.</p><p>The return will only be accepted if you have contacted us prior to returning. Please email us at hello@nodpod.com or call us toll free at 888.486.4224.</p><p>The shipping cost of a returned item is at your expense. We recommend using a method of shipping that allows you to track your package, as we are not responsible for items lost in transit.</p><p>Your return will be processed within 7-10 business days.</p>",
            "expandAnswer": false
          }
        }
